  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Place gnocchi in a large baking dish. Drizzle with olive oil (2 tbs for 2 people / 1/4 cup for 4 people). Season, toss to coat and spread out evenly.\n• Bake until golden, 15-18 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/614a97a02fba0261485f5def/step-5e82b318.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop green olives.\n• Roughly chop silverbeet.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/614a97a02fba0261485f5def/step-0442aa41.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook soffritto mix, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add garlic and dried oregano and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 2 minutes.\n• Add passata, water, brown sugar and vegetable stock powder. Simmer until thickened slightly, 2-3 minutes. Stir olives, silverbeet and red pesto through sauce until silverbeet is wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat. Stir through butter and gnocchi. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/614a97a02fba0261485f5def/step-f24cb6ac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mediterranean tomato and oregano gnocchi between bowls. Crumble fetta cubes on top.\n• Serve garnished with flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/614a97a02fba0261485f5def/step-b2d980a4.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
